  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260112001041.htm
  Category: research
  importance: 92
  ai_summary: "Researchers detected subtle electrical brain signals linked to memory processing years before Alzheimer's diagnosis, offering a new early detection method."
  
